    "raw_text": "Satellite Offices\nOne of my top priorities is to make sure you have access to the services you need close to where you live.\nIn addition to my district offices in Monroeville and McKeesport, we are available at satellite locations across the region to help with an array of state issues, including property tax & rent rebates, free senior bus passes, unemployment compensation, PennDOT requests, unclaimed property, and more!\nCheck out all of our offices to find the one most convenient for you.\nHomestead Satellite Office\nMonday – Wednesday – Thursday | 9:00am – 4:00pm\nTuesday – Friday | By Appointment | 412-664-5200\nHomestead Borough Building\n221 East 7th Avenue | Homestead\nTurtle Creek Satellite Office\nEvery Tuesday | 9:00am – 4:00pm\nTurtle Creek Borough Building\n125 Monroeville Avenue | Turtle Creek\nGlassport Satellite Office\n3rd Wednesday of Every Month | 9:00am – 4:00pm\nGlassport Borough Building\n12 Monongahela Avenue | Glassport\nWhitehall Satellite Office\nEvery Wednesday | 10:00am – 4:00pm\nWhitehall Public Library\n100 Borough Park Drive | Whitehall\nMonroeville Library Satellite Office\n1st Monday of Every Month | 9:00am – 12:00pm\nMonroeville Public Library\n4000 Gateway Campus Boulevard | Monroeville\nNorth Braddock Satellite Office\n3rd Monday of Every Month | 9:00am – 3:00pm\nNorth Braddock Borough Building\n600 Anderson Street | North Braddock\nBrentwood Satellite Office\n3rd Thursday of Every Month | 10:00am – 4:00pm\nBrentwood Public Library\n3501 Brownsville Road | Brentwood\nWhite Oak Satellite Office\n1st Tuesday of Every Month | 9:00am – 12:00pm\nWhite Oak Borough Building\n2280 Lincoln Way | White Oak\nPlum Satellite Office\nMonday – Wednesday – Thursday | 10:00am – 4:00pm\nTuesday – Friday | By Appointment | 412-380-2242\nPlum Borough Community Library\n445 Center New Texas Road | Plum\nNorth Versailles Satellite Office\nEvery Wednesday | 9:00am – 4:00pm\nNorth Versailles Municipal Building\n1401 Greensburg Avenue |